{
  "id": "returning-found-item",
  "title": "把遺失物交給服務台",
  "titleEn": "Returning a Found Item to Information Desk",
  "category": "公共生活",
  "level": "初級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/returning-found-item.webp",
    "alt": "在明亮寬敞的公共場館大廳裡，一位年輕男生站在服務台前，將拾獲的深色皮夾遞給櫃檯裡的女性服務人員，服務人員微笑著接過皮夾並表達感謝。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "While walking inside the community center, Kevin notices a lost leather "
        },
        {
          "text": "wallet",
          "wordIds": [
            "wallet"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on the floor near the "
        },
        {
          "text": "entrance",
          "wordIds": [
            "entrance"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "當凱文走進活動中心時，他注意到大門入口附近的地板上有一個遺失的皮夾。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/returning-found-item/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "d7895ce5281b6a871004dbdb8e5dbccf6df385cbe762e5d421a759b6fc01f8c3",
        "sha256": "22d9007b2478f2d7f71791e6cfb683804ca59bf92cf8013e5de113dfe8778048"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He picks up the lost item and decides to "
        },
        {
          "text": "return",
          "wordIds": [
            "return"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " it right away."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他把遺失的物品撿起來，並決定立刻將它歸還。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/returning-found-item/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "be074549a9fc242bfd4892adae2f1cff5ce86068bc112be473fd4fd08f7eda8e",
        "sha256": "d05bacf31392c798159e32d6655269e76529bf4930b9d2477bd488ac4e6a9855"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Kevin walks across the lobby to the information "
        },
        {
          "text": "desk",
          "wordIds": [
            "desk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to report what he discovered."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "凱文穿過大廳走向服務台，通報他所發現的物品。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/returning-found-item/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "4a7e11e4c6e26e191f6623300a9d18a4af2cae8a46404cc3c61c4790f4501efd",
        "sha256": "0b20e067fe8b2b9b2c694f402713de5819f74f0e91f1a160142bbf900dea1b07"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Approaching the counter, he tells the attendant, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-found-this-wallet-near-the-door"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "found",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-found-this-wallet-near-the-door"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "found"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " this ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-found-this-wallet-near-the-door"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wallet",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-found-this-wallet-near-the-door"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "wallet"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " near the door.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-found-this-wallet-near-the-door"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "走近櫃檯時，他向服務人員說道：「我在門附近撿到了這個皮夾。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/returning-found-item/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "f80325e015ccda1dc84425c73f386cd31137eed6a16f53327511b765a6e6e4e1",
        "sha256": "cd701af17ed7335dca7e2ce5e468e71bf87f4fdd63553b0ff73dfce9a4f8ad32"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "staff",
          "wordIds": [
            "staff"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " member smiles warmly and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where did you find it?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-did-you-find-it"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "工作人員親切地微笑並問道：「你在哪裡找到的？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/returning-found-item/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "c8d3688b9c162d400d4885905c0c36be75525abcdaba1957a0dfb3f7efcb840b",
        "sha256": "efa4307e14995f1254850be01eef8e38aad24115590acd0c925585b793058079"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After Kevin explains what happened, the officer says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thank you for bringing it here.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thank-you-for-bringing-it-here"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在凱文說明事情原委後，服務人員說道：「謝謝你把它拿過來。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/returning-found-item/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "094f474b33f3a4218de445c59ec9fa4458d7e20a879364e1465cfb847d0033a4",
        "sha256": "f581754500833f3221390b6e32b084cbc089cab4b5ea7605aeb858235bf4874d"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She safely stores the item in a drawer and adds, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Someone will be very relieved.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "someone-will-be-very-relieved"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她將物品妥善收進抽屜裡，並補充說：「失主一定會非常安心。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/returning-found-item/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "beddbb9533049496ab5bf8f9f0009a9fbbfd8b774e1eb570371e965619596647",
        "sha256": "1afb3a89c99e95df7d86d43bc4869de4ae3e1e7f7ff807a5a080cc248e9d4833"
      }
    }
  ],
